{"pageid":3467,"title":"Version 1.22.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.22.0</span>","revid":15582,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.22.0\">Version 1.22.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 11th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added the fastest car in the game, The <a href=\"/wiki/Oakmobile\" title=\"Oakmobile\">Oak mobile</a>! Can be purchased at the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">lighthouse</a></li>\n<li>Added the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Saw\" title=\"Refined Saw\">Refined Saw</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elevator\" title=\"Elevator\">Elevators</a> can now change their speed</li>\n<li>Removed fireworks from the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a></li>\n<li>Revamped Saw combining</li>\n<li>Revamped Sander combining</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing coil</a> now heals at 5hp/s (3hp/s prior)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kawai_Kitsune_(WMI_Vinyl)\" title=\"Kawai Kitsune (WMI Vinyl)\">WMI Vinyl</a> was fixed, and will be automatically put into gramophones!</li>\n<li>Fixed issue with <a href=\"/wiki/Garage_Door\" title=\"Garage Door\">Garage Doors</a> being replicatable with BuildMode</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163729\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 17/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n--